{
  "name": "Account Scanner · Run by webhook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Account Scanner · Run by webhook\nOptional. Needs a credential of type **Header Auth** named `Account Scanner Key` (header `X-Scanner-Key`).\n\n- `POST /webhook/scanner/run` with `{ \"location\", \"intent_signal\", \"lookback_hours\", \"runs\", \"target\", \"sub_areas\", \"concurrency\" }` runs *Account Scanner* and answers with the run summary when it is done. What you leave out comes from its Settings node.\n- `POST /webhook/scanner/rows` answers with everything in `scanner_companies` and `scanner_runs`.\n\nThe tests of this repository use both.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      },
